From 6ccecbe95d32db18cd1915cd6f28faff61195e51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Natalie Vock <natalie.vock@gmx.de>
Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 16:29:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [FOR-UPSTREAM] drm/amd/display: Wait for flip completion
 before cleaning up fbs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

When performing async flips, we can dispatch the flip without waiting
for vblank, but we still need to actually wait for the flip. Otherwise
the framebuffer objects are unpinned too early and things to way south
if we happen to be under memory pressure and try evicting the
framebuffers.

Signed-off-by: Natalie Vock <natalie.vock@gmx.de>
Signed-off-by: Nícolas F. R. A. Prado <nfraprado@collabora.com>
Signed-off-by: Henry Paradiz <henry.paradiz@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm.c | 4 +---
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm.c
index c47586801b89..0c10eafd4782 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/display/amdgpu_dm/amdgpu_dm.c
@@ -12003,9 +12003,7 @@ static void amdgpu_dm_atomic_commit_tail(struct drm_atomic_commit *state)
 	/* Signal HW programming completion */
 	drm_atomic_helper_commit_hw_done(state);
 
-	if (wait_for_vblank)
-		drm_atomic_helper_wait_for_flip_done(dev, state);
-
+	drm_atomic_helper_wait_for_flip_done(dev, state);
 	drm_atomic_helper_cleanup_planes(dev, state);
 
 	/* Don't free the memory if we are hitting this as part of suspend.
-- 
2.55.0

